<title>JAPAN: Hamamatsu Photonics plans 1.05-for-1 share split.</title>
<headline>Hamamatsu Photonics plans 1.05-for-1 share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hamamatsu Photonics Co Ltd said on Thursday it planned a 1.05-for-1 share split on November 20, for shareholders as of September 30.</p>
</text>
